  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 Wound</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> 10-space radius</p><p>You bellow a challenge to your enemies, compelling them to face you.</p><p>As an <strong>Action</strong>, choose any number of creatures within a <strong>10-space radius</strong> of you, and make a<strong> 4:1 Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check, resisted by the creature's <strong>Willpower</strong>.</p><p>If a chosen creature fails, its <strong>Melee</strong> and <strong>Accuracy</strong> are reduced by <strong>-1</strong> when attacking creatures other than you. If it casts a targeted offensive spell that does not target you, then the <strong>Complexity</strong> of the spell is increased by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become <strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.bLLwyrv7KuVS1JLe]{The Dragon Conquers}</p>",
